        },
        {
          "text": "Jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam, ma kite no, ama nyalo konyo wan i gima wayenyo. Ato go leŋ, ongoye kodi kibenga kosa gimarac moro, olony, m'opok kwoŋ joreco, aka otiŋ go malo kalo polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.26"
            ]
          }
