                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go kicale jodongo pa jocway ri Were i wi migam man; go kiyenyere cowirok wi migam ndelo je: Ni kutho ri reco pere won, aka nyaka wocowere ri reco pa joman bende. Go ocowere wi migam dicel kende to makicutho, munyo go won omiyere paka cowirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
