              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cik pa Musa ketho dhano m'obedo gima nyap bedo jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam; to wac ma kwoŋirok pa Were, m'obino rumacen yuŋey Cik, oketho Wod Were won m'otiek loko m'olony kicutho cil gi cil.",
          "type": "text",
